WEBVTT

00:31:59.917 --> 00:32:00.934
(Laughter)

00:32:00.958 --> 00:32:03.143
Is this what happens
in your therapy sessions?

00:32:03.167 --> 00:32:04.917
(Laughter)

00:32:07.917 --> 00:32:09.184
EP: Yes.
AG: OK.

00:32:09.208 --> 00:32:10.934
So now what, what do I do?

00:32:10.958 --> 00:32:12.809
(Laughter)

00:32:12.833 --> 00:32:15.601
EP: So if you were in a session with me,

00:32:15.625 --> 00:32:17.768
I would say "For the moment
you do nothing.

00:32:17.792 --> 00:32:20.726
You just had a new thought, sit with it."

00:32:20.750 --> 00:32:25.309
So when you realize
that in a way you go for the things

00:32:25.333 --> 00:32:30.268
that you can pretty much have more agency
about from the beginning to the end,